flowchart LR
    s0["<b>candidates</b><br/>Every move worth a look: each spare sold, and each player you could get, from your cash, if worth anything at a glance (worth). What a buy needs beyond your cash, the plan raises by selling."]
    s1["<b>rank</b><br/>Each move, scored against doing nothing in simulated seasons."]
    s0 --> s1
    s2["<b>verdict</b><br/>Worth doing only if it gains and is likely to help"]
    s1 --> s2
    s3["<b>plan</b><br/>The best set of moves to make together"]
    s2 --> s3
    s3 --> board(["the board"])
